OL,3,GNEWSAUp-to-date national statistics
OL,4,Astill months away
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe release of up-to-date statistics on
OL,7,Fthe size of Guernsey's population and
OL,8,Feconomy are still months away according
OL,9,Fto Policy and Resources (P&R), after
OL,10,Fproblems with the revenue service.
OL,12,FPresident of P&R Lindsay de Sausmarez
OL,13,Fsaid she was concerned about delays to
OL,14,Fthe publication of "important national
OL,15,Fstatistics".
OL,17,FIssues at the revenue service have been
OL,18,Fwell-publicised, after the States Chief
OL,19,FExecutive Boley Smillie admitted a
OL,20,Fmulti-million pound IT transformation
OL,21,Fproject at the service had delivered
OL,22,Flittle to no benefits.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
